  "description": "Three years into their marriage, the love between Su-An and Seon-U, once overflowing, was beginning to dry up. Back when they were newlyweds, they’d make love whenever their eyes met, in the bedroom, the living room, and even the bathroom, but now he couldn’t even remember when they last had sex. Su-An, whose dream had been to have a child and build a happy family, was already thirty-seven, at this age, even if he got pregnant tomorrow, it would be considered an advanced-age pregnancy. He had to rekindle his relationship with his husband and have a child before it was too late. And so, Su-An’s desperate “offensive” (?) against Seon-U began...!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
